00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:48.501
(spritzing)

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:50.240
(laughs)

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.679
- Okay!

00:01:51.679 --> 00:01:52.746
All right.

00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:55.228
