[Woman] She always smells

00:02:17.087 --> 00:02:18.245
- She has really good, like,
[Woman] a little angel.

00:02:18.245 --> 00:02:19.361
detergent or something. (laughs)

00:02:19.361 --> 00:02:20.884
- I just woke up, and usually,

00:02:20.884 --> 00:02:22.006
